{"唯我们可见的星群如此真实。"}
[00:35.377]And in your eyes, I see the endless deep,
{"在你眼中我看见无垠深海，"}
[00:40.001]A silent language that my soul can keep.
{"我的灵魂能读懂这静默语言。"}
[00:50.513]You and I,
{"你和我，"}
[00:52.632]We're a constellation,
{"我们就是璀璨星群，"}
[00:54.658]Bright and timeless,
{"明亮而永恒，"}
[00:56.811]'Cause we're made of starlight,
{"因我们由星光铸就，"}
[00:59.029]Burning through the darkness,
{"在黑暗中燃烧，"}
[01:01.084]Keep us in rotation.
{"让我们永续运转。"}
